BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 738.000000 Td (1. Visual Data Flow: Data movement is explicit in the code syntax. Variable) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 724.000000 Td (binding and assignment use -> \(moving left-to-right into the target\), while) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 710.000000 Td (function returns, yields, and emissions use <- \(returning outward to the) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 696.000000 Td (caller\).) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 682.000000 Td (2. Explicitness Over Magic: No hidden type coercions, no implicit variable) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 668.000000 Td (captures, and no silent conversions. Absence is represented by Nothing, and) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 654.000000 Td (type zero-states are represented by Default.) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 640.000000 Td (3. Dual Execution Parity: Every valid Zenlang program \(.zl\) executes) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 626.000000 Td (identically in two complementary modes without code changes:) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 612.000000 Td (- Interpreted Script & Bytecode Mode: Direct AST/bytecode execution for) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 598.000000 Td (instantaneous feedback and rapid iteration.) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 584.000000 Td (- Native Compiled Mode \(-g\): Ahead-Of-Time \(AOT\) transpilation to optimized C) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 570.000000 Td (and native machine code, linking with the shared runtime in runtime/.) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 556.000000 Td (4. Terminal as a First-Class Citizen: Sub-millisecond ANSI canvas rendering,) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 542.000000 Td (60 FPS redraw capabilities, interactive keyboard polling, and declarative) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 528.000000 Td (table formatting are standard library primitives.) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 514.000000 Td (5. Snapshot-by-Value Concurrency: Captured outer variables are snapshotted by) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 500.000000 Td (value at instantiation time, eliminating data races without heavy runtime) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 486.000000 Td (locks.) Tj ET
BT 0.054902 0.133333 0.121569 rg /F3 10 Tf 54.000000 472.000000 Td (6. Pure Native Self-Hosting Architecture: The compiler is written in Zenlang) Tj ET
